---
source: crates/rustman-cli/src/tests.rs
expression: help
---
Delete snapshot files that no request uses anymore (with --yes or after confirmation on a terminal)

Usage: rustman snapshot prune [OPTIONS] [PATH]

Arguments:
  [PATH]
          A folder or request file to limit pruning to (default: the whole workspace)

Options:
      --dry-run
          Only list what would be deleted

  -y, --yes
          Delete without asking

      --workspace <DIR>
          Workspace directory (default: search from the current directory upwards)

      --color <WHEN>
          Color: auto (a terminal without NO_COLOR or TERM=dumb), always or never
          
          [default: auto]

  -v, --verbose...
          Log more on stderr: -v requests, -vv headers, -vvv everything (RUST_LOG, when set, replaces these levels)

  -h, --help
          Print help
